431	 * a fence opens with at least three backticks or tildes (up to three spaces of
432	 * indent) and closes with the same character, at least as many of them, and
433	 * nothing else on the line. A fence never closed runs to the end of the text,
434	 * which is the safe direction -- the rest is evidence rather than bookkeeping.
